Store graphics, not part of the package.

cover-1080x540.jpg, banner-1032x504.jpg, banner-516x252.jpg: cut from
cover art AI-generated with Grok (xAI) in October 2026 from a prompt
written with the author, in the style of the Asteroid Blaster cover; the
grey rock tones tinted towards Blaster's violet with ImageMagick.
title-art-864x1920.jpg: the portrait cut of the same art, as shipped in
qml/game/img/title-art.jpg.

screenshot-start-720x1600.png: the title screen on the author's Jolla C2
(native resolution), 2026-10-14.
screenshot-action-720x1600.png: a round in play on the C2, level 2,
score 722, two near-miss combos (+36, +34); chosen by the author from a
burst of 12 (one every 10 s), unedited.
screenshot-gameover-720x1600.png: the game over screen on the C2, taken
after the fix that shrinks long difficulty names to fit.
screenshot-*-1080x2400.jpg: the same, scaled by 1.5 to the width the
Harbour form asks for. icon-172x172.png: the launcher icon.

store-listing.md has every form field.
